"- dialog \"Create task\":\n  - heading \"Create task\" [level=2]\n  - paragraph: Create a task, name its owner and choose who will do the work.\n  - button \"Close\"\n  - group:\n    - text: Task title\n    - textbox \"Task title\"\n    - text: Brief\n    - textbox \"Brief\"\n    - text: Area of work\n    - combobox \"Area of work\":\n      - option \"Marketing\" [selected]\n      - option \"Feedback\"\n    - text: Priority\n    - combobox \"Priority\":\n      - option \"Low\"\n      - option \"Normal\" [selected]\n      - option \"High\"\n      - option \"Urgent\"\n    - text: Due date\n    - textbox \"Due date\"\n    - paragraph: Calendar date; no time or reminder is set.\n  - group \"Responsibility\":\n    - text: Responsibility\n    - paragraph: An owner is accountable for the result. The assignee does the work; a person reviews it.\n    - text: Accountable owner\n    - combobox \"Accountable owner\":\n      - option \"Amal · Synthetic owner\"\n      - option \"Root acceptance manager\"\n      - option \"Samira · Synthetic manager\"\n      - option \"Synthetic review · Maya · Manager\" [selected]\n      - option \"Synthetic review · Noura · Member\"\n    - text: Assigned to\n    - combobox \"Assigned to\":\n      - option \"Unassigned\" [selected]\n      - option \"Amal · Synthetic owner\"\n      - option \"Atlas · Synthetic agent · Agent\"\n      - option \"Root acceptance manager\"\n      - option \"Samira · Synthetic manager\"\n      - option \"Synthetic review · Maya · Manager\"\n      - option \"Synthetic review · Noura · Member\"\n    - text: Reviewer\n    - combobox \"Reviewer\":\n      - option \"Any authorized human reviewer\" [selected]\n      - option \"Amal · Synthetic owner\"\n      - option \"Root acceptance manager\"\n      - option \"Samira · Synthetic manager\"\n      - option \"Synthetic review · Maya · Manager\"\n    - paragraph: Only a person with review access can accept completed work.\n  - button \"Cancel\"\n  - button \"Create task\" [disabled]"
